@startuml
title C13 notebook section and page editing
' Traces: OMCT-C13-L2-01.02
actor Operator
participant "NotebookView" as View
participant "SectionCollection" as Sections
participant "PageCollection" as Pages
participant "@cupola/core NotebookService" as NotebookService
participant "HttpObjectsGateway" as ObjectsGateway
participant "Cupola.Api ObjectsController" as ObjectsController
participant "Cupola.Core IObjectStore" as Store
participant "RealtimeHub" as Hub

Operator -> View: perform section or page operation
activate View
alt section operation
  View -> Sections: add, rename, reorder, or delete
  activate Sections
  Sections -> NotebookService: update section structure
  activate NotebookService
  NotebookService --> Sections: updated notebook
  deactivate NotebookService
  Sections --> View: updated notebook
  deactivate Sections
else page operation
  View -> Pages: add, rename, reorder, or delete
  activate Pages
  Pages -> NotebookService: update page structure
  activate NotebookService
  NotebookService --> Pages: updated notebook
  deactivate NotebookService
  Pages --> View: updated notebook
  deactivate Pages
end
View -> ObjectsGateway: saveNotebook(updated notebook)
activate ObjectsGateway
ObjectsGateway -> ObjectsController: update domain object
activate ObjectsController
ObjectsController -> Store: persist notebook structure
activate Store
Store --> ObjectsController: persisted notebook
deactivate Store
ObjectsController -> Hub: emit objectChanged
activate Hub
Hub --> ObjectsController: broadcast accepted
deactivate Hub
ObjectsController --> ObjectsGateway: persisted notebook
deactivate ObjectsController
ObjectsGateway --> View: persisted notebook
deactivate ObjectsGateway
View --> Operator: display persisted structure
deactivate View
@enduml
